{
  "id": "LUK.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 10",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obotomwa bw’aborokigwa emerongo etano na ebere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega ase aya Omonene agachora abande emerongo etano na ebere na babere (72), akabatoma babere babere bamotang’anere kogenda kera omochie na kera aase arengereretie kogenda ere omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Rigesa nerinene, korende abakori emeremo nabake; gaki mosabe Omonene bwe rigesa atome abakori emeremo ase rigesa riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwatia enchera; rigereria, nabatomire inwe buna chimanwa chi’eching’ondi gati‐gati ye chisese chi’orosana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobogoria ekemoya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", gose esaro, gose ebikoroto; gose timokwania monto nchera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na enyomba ende yonsi morasoe, ritang’ani mobore: Omorembe obe ase enyomba eye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto bw’omorembe oreo, omorembe oino noikaranse asare; korende onye taibo, nobairanere inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobeere ase enyomba eyio, morie na konywa ebi bakobaa, ekiagera omokori emeremo nagwenerete aegwe eng’eria yaye. Timoetanana enyomba ase enyomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omochie onde bwonsi morasoe, na abanto b’omochie oyio baabaariganie, karie eki barabae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mogwenie abarwaire abareo, mobateebie: Oborwoti bwa Nyasae bwabaikeire ang’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kero kende gionsi mogosoa omochie, na barabwo batabaariganeti, soka korwa aroro, eta ase chinchera chiaye, motebe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya norotu rw’omochie oino rwabwatereire amagoro aito twarwabusire ase more, korende manya aya, ng’a oborwoti bwa Nyasae bwaikire ang’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabateebirie, nabe aororo ase Sodomu ase rituko riria kobua omochie oria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoragererigwa ase emechie etari nokwegena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 11:20-24)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwao, Korasini! Obobe nobwao, Bethisaida! Ekiagera onye mbiakoregete ase Turo na Sidoni ebikone bie chinguru ebiakoregete ase more, abanto b’aroro anga mbaonchogete kare na goikaransa babegete chianga chi’echigunia na beagete ribu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nebe aororo ase Turo na Sidoni ase rituko riria ri’ekiina kobua ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kapernaumu, noimokererigwe igoro? Noche goikigwa goika Eora y’amakweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oyorabaigwere inwe, nanyigwere nainche, na ere oyorabaange inwe, onyangire nainche, na ere oyoranyange inche, omwangire ere oyontomete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoirana kwa baria emerongo etano na ebere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baria emerongo etano na ebere na babere (72) bakairana nomogooko, bagateeba, “Omonene, nonya nebirecha biatoigwereire ase erieta riao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Naroche Saitani okogwa korwa igoro buna okomesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, nabaeire okobua gotindacha ching’iti chionsi, na ebiuge, ne chinguru chionsi chi’oria omobisa; gose gento kende tikeri kerabaite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nabo timogoka ase aya, ng’a ebirecha biabaigwereire, korende goka ekiagera amarieta aino arikirwe igoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 11:25-27; 13:16-17)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ekero keria Yeso agasasoka ase Omoika Omochenu, akabora, “Nakobakire aye Tata, Omonene o igoro na ense, ng’a kwabisire amang’ana aya ase abare nobong’aini ne chisemi, na koyamaanora ase abana abake. Ee, Tata, oko nakwo kwarenge ogwancha kwao okuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naeirwe ebinto bionsi na Tata one; monto onde tari omomanyete Omwana gose nere ng’o, otatiga Tata, gose Tata nere ng’o, otatiga Omwana, na onde bwensi Omwana anchire komoorokeria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaonchokera aborokigwa baye, akabateebia bobisi, “Nasesenirie amaiso aya arorire ayamwarorire inwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nabateebirie, ababani abange na abarwoti bakarigia korora ayamwarorire inwe, tibayarora, na koigwa aya mwaigure, tibayaigwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoreng’anio bwo’mosamaria omuya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 22:34-40; Mar 12:28-31)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, omworokia bw’amachiiko agatenena okomoteema, okobora, “Omworokia, inki ndakore nyore obogima bwa kare na kare?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akamobooria, “Ase amachiiko inki keriikire? Naki ogosoma?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairaneria, “Mwanche Omonene Nyasae oo nenkoro yao yonsi, na omoyo oo bwonsi, ne chinguru chiao chionsi, na obong’aini bwao bwonsi, na omogisangio oo buna bweanchete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoteebia, “Kwairaneirie buya. Kora iga, nario oramenye amatuko amange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria akarigia gwekora omonyene oboronge, akaboria Yeso, “Omogisangio one nere ng’o?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akairaneria, “Narenge omonto ore gotirimboka korwa Yerusalemu kogenda Yeriko. Ere akaumera abauri, na barabwo bakamoumokera, bakamorusia chianga, bakamoaka chingoma, bakagenda, bakamotiga oisire gokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba agwo Omokuani oyomo akaoroka, ogoeta ase enchera eria, akamorora, agaeta ensemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omolawi boigo agachia goika aase aria, akamorora; nere agaeta ensemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omosamaria oyomo, kagoeta, agacha aase arenge; ere agachia komoorora, akamororera amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo akamoika ang’e, akamoboa chingoma chiaye, akamoaka amaguta na edivai; akamoriinia ase etigere yaye igoro, akamoira ase enyomba y’abageni, akamorwaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika mambia yaye akarua chisiringi ibere, akaa omonyene enyomba, akamoteebia: Morende buya; na kende gionsi orarue kobua, kondairane naende, ningoakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki rende orooche ase aba iga batato, norori orenge omoamate oye ere oyogwete ase amaboko y’abauri?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabora, “Noria omoororerete amaabera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamoteebia, “Genda naye okore boigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogosoa ase enka ya Martha na Mariamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bare kogenda orogendo rwabo, agasoa ase agachie akamo, na omokungu oyomo, erieta riaye Martha, akamoarigania nyomba mwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere narenge nomosubati omwabo ore korokwa Mariamu oyio oikaransete ase amagoro a Yeso, koigwa amang’ana aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Martha nigo arenge gochandeka ase ogokora okonge, akamochiera, akabora, “Omonene, torochi aye buna oyominto antigire ngokora kera egento inche bweka? Moteebie ankonye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoiraneria, “Martha, Martha, nigo okwerosia na gweichania ase engencho y’ebinto ebinge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende egento ekemo gioka keganeirie. Mariamu ochorire ensemo ere engiya, eye ataurwe nonde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
